{"id":"fa_hig","lemma":"fähig","pos":"adj","rank":1876,"glosses":["capable (having the general capability to)","able (currently in the position to; most often mentally)","qualified; skilled; skilful"],"ipa":"/ˈfɛːɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4b/De-f%C3%A4hig.ogg/De-f%C3%A4hig.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"fähiger","superlative":"am fähigsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Bist du dazu fähig?","en":"Are you capable of that?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in addition to it"},null]},{"text":"Er ist ein fähiger Anwalt.","en":"He is a capable lawyer.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"attorney, lawyer"}]},{"text":"Wir wissen, wozu du fähig bist.","en":"We know what you're capable of.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"for what reason"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Sein Bruder ist ein sehr fähiger Arzt.","en":"His brother is a very capable doctor.","words":[{"g":"to be"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"doctor, physician"}]},{"text":"Er war ein äußerst fähiger Mann.","en":"He was an extremely able man.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"utmostly, extremely"},null,{"g":"man, male human being"}]}]}